-- 20260823000004_seed_products.sql
--
-- Seed data fix for Root Cause 3 in docs/bug-fix-scope.md: the storefront
-- home page (`src/app/(storefront)/page.tsx`) renders the "No products
-- available yet" empty state because the `products` table (created by
-- 20260823000000_create_payload_collections.sql) has zero rows — no seed
-- data exists anywhere in this repository (confirmed: no `insert into` in
-- any file under supabase/migrations/, no seed script in package.json).
--
-- This migration inserts:
--   1. 45 `media` rows (placeholder product photos) — required first because
--      products.image_id is a NOT NULL FK to media(id) (see
--      20260823000000_create_payload_collections.sql line 80).
--   2. 45 `products` rows with realistic Glowrie skincare catalog data,
--      matching the exact columns/types/constraints of the `products` table
--      as created in 20260823000000_create_payload_collections.sql and as
--      defined in src/collections/Products.ts. Every row uses
--      status = 'published' so it passes both the storefront's explicit
--      `where: { status: { equals: 'published' } }` query filter
--      (src/app/(storefront)/page.tsx) and the Products collection's
--      anonymous-read access rule (src/collections/Products.ts
--      access.read — public may only read status === 'published').
--
-- Out of scope for this migration (explicitly NOT touched here, per other
-- root causes in docs/bug-fix-scope.md which are separate follow-ups):
--   - push: false in src/lib/payload.config.ts (Root Cause 2)
--   - the users_sessions table migration (Root Cause 2)
--   - .env DATABASE_URI changes (Root Cause 1/2 follow-ups)
--
-- Apply the same way the other hand-written workaround migrations in this
-- project are applied (see 20260823000000_create_payload_collections.sql
-- and 20260823000001_create_visitor_logs.sql): via the Supabase CLI
-- (`supabase db push` / `supabase migration up`) or by pasting this file's
-- contents into the Supabase Dashboard's SQL Editor and running it, since
-- `pnpm payload migrate` cannot run in this checkout (Root Cause 1).

-- ============================================================================
-- MEDIA (created before PRODUCTS since products.image_id references it)
-- ============================================================================

